---
import SettingsFrame from "../../components/account/settings-frame.astro";
---

<SettingsFrame active="Refer Options" heading="Refer Options">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
    <h3 class="text-xs font-bold">Refer users and get credits</h3>
    <p>
      Out of credits again? Can't find staff that is willing to fill up your
      purse? Want to buy that shiny rare but just don't have the credits for it?
      Don't stress, just get a few friends to sign up on [[ .ShortName ]]! Do
      that, and your purse will be filled again in no time! Below are a few
      options you have at your disposal.
    </p>
    <h3 class="text-xs font-bold">Referral Options</h3>
    <p>
      There are two ways you can use to get refers, and with that, free credits.
    </p>
    <p>
      <b>1. Send your friends a link</b><br />This option is probably as easy as
      it gets; it basically does step 2, but automatically! You just send your
      friends an invite with the link shown below, your friends click the link,
      and if they complete registration, you get free credits! This is your
      referral link to get some easy credits:
    </p>
    <input
      type="text"
      disabled
      value="[[ .ReferralLink ]]"
      class="w-4/5 border border-neutral-500 bg-gray-200 p-0.5"
    />
    <p>
      <b>2. Let them fill in your name during registration</b><br />During the
      registration process, users can manually give the username of the person
      that referred them to the site. If they complete registration, that person
      gets credits! And that person could be you, if you have some friends that
      are nice enough to fill in your username.
    </p>
    <h3 class="text-xs font-bold">Today's Referral Reward</h3>
    <p>
      This is the amount of credits you get per user you refer. This amount may
      change over time.
    </p>
    <p><b>[[ .Reward ]]</b> credits <sup>per refer</sup></p>
  </div>
</SettingsFrame>
